BookOrbit for Mihon

Independently implemented client using official public interface contracts.
This project is not an official BookOrbit or Mihon release and makes no endorsement claim.

API references (no server implementation copied or bundled):
  BookOrbit https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit
  Copyright (C) 2025-2026 neon and respective BookOrbit contributors.
  Upstream server: AGPL-3.0-only with its own additional terms.

Compile-time host interfaces:
  Mihon https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon (Apache-2.0)
  TachiyomiX 1.6.0 https://github.com/mihonapp/tachiyomix (Apache-2.0)
  AndroidX Preference 1.2.1 (Apache-2.0)
  Host-supplied Kotlin, coroutines, serialization, OkHttp and Injekt are compileOnly.
  These host libraries and stub implementations are not bundled in the APK.

Gradle wrapper scripts/JAR are generated by Gradle and distributed under Apache-2.0.
The extension icon is an original vector drawing; no upstream logos are included.
